1\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 with SGLang - 20B image editing model with text rendering, character consistency, and geometric reasoning.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/diffusion/Qwen-Image/Qwen-Image-Edit\"}]},{\"group\":\"Z-Image\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Z-Image-Turbo\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Z-Image-Turbo with SGLang - community contribution guide for Z-Image's fast image generation model.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/diffusion/Z-Image/Z-Image-Turbo\"}]},{\"group\":\"MOVA\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"MOVA\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy MOVA with SGLang - simultaneous video and audio generation with asymmetric dual-tower architecture, precise lip-sync, and environment-aware sound effects.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/diffusion/MOVA/MOVA\"}]},{\"group\":\"LingBot World\",\"tag\":\"NEW\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"LingBot World\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Serve LingBot World realtime camera-controlled video world models with SGLang-diffusion.\"},\"tag\":\"REALTIME\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/diffusion/LingBot-World/LingBot-World\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"SpecBundle\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Supported Models\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"SpecBundle supported EAGLE3 draft models for speculative decoding - Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek, GLM, and more.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/specbundle/supported_models\"},{\"title\":\"SpecBundle Usage\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"SpecBundle usage guide - production-grade EAGLE3 speculative decoding with SGLang for faster LLM inference.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/specbundle/specbundle_usage\"}]},{\"group\":\"Benchmarks\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Autoregressive Model Benchmark Documentation\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Benchmark LLM and VLM serving throughput and latency with sglang.bench_serving - supports SGLang, vLLM, and multiple datasets.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/base/benchmarks/autoregressive_model_benchmark\"},{\"title\":\"Diffusion Models Benchmark Documentation\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Benchmark diffusion model serving throughput and latency with SGLang - supports image and video generation with flexible configurations.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/base/benchmarks/diffusion_model_benchmark\"}]}]}]},{\"tab\":\"SGLang Diffusion\",\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"SGLang Diffusion\",\"icon\":\"sparkles\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"SGLang Diffusion\",\"description\":\"Accelerated image and video generation with diffusion models.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/index\"},{\"title\":\"Install SGLang Diffusion\",\"description\":\"Install SGLang Diffusion on NVIDIA, AMD, MUSA, and Ascend platforms.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/installation\"},{\"title\":\"Supported Models\",\"description\":\"Check model compatibility across diffusion optimizations and backends.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/compatibility_matrix\"},{\"title\":\"Disaggregated Diffusion Pipeline\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Split SGLang Diffusion pipelines into independent encoder, denoiser, and decoder services for disaggregated serving.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/disaggregation\"},{\"title\":\"Quantization\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"SGLang-Diffusion supports quantized transformer checkpoints. In most cases, keep the base model and the quantized transformer override separate.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/quantization\"},{\"group\":\"Usage\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"CLI reference\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"CLI\",\"description\":\"Run one-off generation tasks and launch the HTTP server from the command line.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/api/cli\"},{\"title\":\"OpenAI API\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"OpenAI API\",\"description\":\"Image and video generation endpoints with LoRA adapter management.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/api/openai_api\"},{\"title\":\"Post-Processing\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Use SGLang Diffusion post-processing for frame interpolation and spatial upscaling after generation.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/api/post_processing\"}]},{\"group\":\"Performance Optimization\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Performance Optimization\",\"description\":\"Optimize SGLang diffusion performance with caching, kernels, and profiling.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/performance-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"Ring SP Benchmark: Wan2.2-TI2V-5B (u1r2 vs Baseline)\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Review Ring-SP benchmark results for Wan2.2-TI2V-5B-Diffusers in SGLang Diffusion.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/ring_sp_performance\"},{\"title\":\"Attention Backends\",\"description\":\"Select and configure attention backends for SGLang diffusion pipelines.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/attention_backends\"},{\"group\":\"Inference Batching\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Inference Batching\",\"description\":\"Batch compatible native SGLang-Diffusion requests during serving.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/dynamic_batching\"}]},{\"title\":\"Profiling\",\"description\":\"Profile SGLang diffusion workloads with PyTorch Profiler and Nsight Systems.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/profiling\"},{\"title\":\"CI Performance Baselines\",\"description\":\"Generate and update diffusion performance baselines used in CI.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/ci_perf\"}]},{\"group\":\"Caching Strategies\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Caching Acceleration\",\"description\":\"Compare caching acceleration strategies for diffusion models.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/caching-acceleration\"},{\"title\":\"Cache-DiT Acceleration\",\"description\":\"Configure Cache-DiT acceleration for diffusion inference.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/cache_dit\"},{\"title\":\"TeaCache Acceleration\",\"description\":\"Configure TeaCache for temporal similarity-based diffusion acceleration.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/teacache\"}]},{\"group\":\"References\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Environment Variables\",\"description\":\"Configure SGLang diffusion behavior with environment variables.\",\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/environment_variables\"},{\"title\":\"How to Support New Diffusion Models\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"This document explains how to add support for new diffusion models in SGLang Diffusion.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/support_new_models\"},{\"title\":\"Contributing to SGLang Diffusion\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"This guide outlines the requirements for contributing to the SGLang Diffusion module (sglang.multimodalgen).\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/docs/sglang-diffusion/contributing\"}]}]}]}]},\"anonymizedNav\":\"$undefined\"},\"children\":\"$L39\"}]}]}]}]]}]}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1b:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"theme\":\"aspen\",\"pageMetadata\":{\"title\":\"Welcome to SGLang\",\"description\":\"High-performance serving framework for large language and multimodal models.\",\"keywords\":[\"sglang\",\"llm serving\",\"multimodal\",\"inference runtime\"],\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/index\"},\"docsConfig\":{\"theme\":\"aspen\",\"$schema\":\"https://mintlify.com/docs.json\",\"name\":\"SGLang Documentation\",\"colors\":{\"primary\":\"#d55816\",\"light\":\"#d55816\",\"dark\":\"#d55816\"},\"logo\":{\"light\":\"https://mintcdn.com/lmsysorg/iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC/logo/logo.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC\u0026q=85\u0026s=b27d467947ee2167744cb07b69badf00\",\"dark\":\"https://mintcdn.com/lmsysorg/iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC/logo/logo.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC\u0026q=85\u0026s=b27d467947ee2167744cb07b69badf00\"},\"favicon\":\"https://mintcdn.com/lmsysorg/iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC/favicon.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=iZdDMbLWP1BLEIzC\u0026q=85\u0026s=5524ba9694253eabf4da70fafa1db208\",\"background\":{\"decoration\":\"grid\",\"colo